        "TileImage": "$($repository f3a43486-27cb-489e-be07-8f8fde47e638).Image",
        "Description": "The GAMA Facility currently has a lot of patients suffering from intestinal problems (and, according to our intel, their numbers are expected to rise quite a bit). One of them, however, is very problematic, and has been locking himself in a toilet for days, refusing to let anyone approach. The Facility really needs that toilet. They want the &quot;problem&quot; dealt with in a fast, silent, and lethal manner - something only a ninja could do.\r\rNin Nin, 47.",
